# Batch files must reach Windows with CRLF endings. cmd.exe label and goto
# parsing is the known weak spot with LF-only files, and run.bat depends on
# both throughout, so this is cheap insurance on a file that cannot be tested
# from a Linux CI host.
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Shell scripts must keep LF even when checked out on Windows, or the shebang
# carries a stray CR and the interpreter is not found.
*.sh text eol=lf

# PDFs and images in sample-output/ are committed reference output.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
